{
  "abstract": "We have measured the cross section for the reaction \u03c0\u2212p\u2192\u03c00+anything at an incident momentum of 5 GeV/c. The two \u03b3 rays from \u03c00 decays were detected using a 150-element lead-glass hodoscope array. A comparison is given of the inclusive \u03c00 spectrum from hydrogen (obtained through a subtraction of CH2 and C target data) with \u03c00 production from C and Cu.",
